.TH REPTILLUS 1 "October 2026" "Reptillus" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
reptillus \- graphical file manager for Rebuntu
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B reptillus
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.RI [ URI ... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Reptillus
is a graphical file manager derived from GNOME Files (Nautilus).
It can browse local files and supported virtual locations.
.SH OPTIONS
Run
.B reptillus --help
for the options supported by this build.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nautilus (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Reptillus contributors; based on GNOME Nautilus.
